{"channelId":"UCPlmxtU8UeEOHPsq5DopUiA","row":["AHIMSA HAVEN ANIMAL RESCUE",2,"Ahimsa Haven was incorporated in 1999 as a nonprofit animal rescue group. Our mission is to find good homes for abused, abandoned, homeless and unwanted domestic animals. We raise money through donations, grants, and fundraising events in order to provide routine and emergency medical care for animals in need. Every penny we raise goes to the animals - no one gets a salary!","info@ahimsahaven.org","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPlmxtU8UeEOHPsq5DopUiA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPlmxtU8UeEOHPsq5DopUiA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:22.546Z"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPlmxtU8UeEOHPsq5DopUiA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:22.546Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPlmxtU8UeEOHPsq5DopUiA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2,"raw":"2 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPlmxtU8UeEOHPsq5DopUiA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:22.546Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"info@ahimsahaven.org","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://www.ahimsahaven.org/contactsvisiting.html"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:05037f62eab89dc92c1aef36"],"observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:44:48.988Z","deliveryVerified":false,"dnsStatus":"unknown","context":"页面原文: EMAIL[email protected]\nHTML data-cfemail: 0e676068614e6f6667637d6f666f786b6020617c69\n公开显示邮箱: info@ahimsahaven.org\n提取方法: data_cfemail（静态显示属性解码，无登录或挑战请求）","raw":"0e676068614e6f6667637d6f666f786b6020617c69"}],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"organization_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPlmxtU8UeEOHPsq5D